    "html": "<p>A mass of 2.0 kg of water is cooling down in a sealed container. At time <em>t</em><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"_{1}\"></span> the temperature is 273 K. At time <em>t</em><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"_{2}\"></span>, there is 0.5 kg of water in the container. </p>\n<p>Which graph shows how the temperature <em>T</em> inside the container varies with time <em>t</em>?</p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">Option A is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"B\">Option B is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"C\">Option C is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"D\">Option D is shown in the figure above.</li></ol>"
